msgstr "Esa jugada no resuelve el ejercicio."

#. Spoken by the tablebase judge after a move that turned a win into a draw.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/judge.py:173
msgid "That move let the win slip: the position is now a draw."
msgstr "Esa jugada dejó escapar la victoria: la posición ahora es tablas."

#. Spoken by the tablebase judge after a move that turned a draw into a loss.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/judge.py:178
msgid "That move lost the draw: the position is now lost."
msgstr "Esa jugada perdió las tablas: la posición ahora está perdida."

#. Spoken by the tablebase judge after a move that turned a win into a loss.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/judge.py:176
msgid "That move turned a won position into a lost one."
msgstr "Esa jugada convirtió una posición ganada en una perdida."

#. Rule taught by a lesson position.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/lessons.py:192
msgid ""
"The attacking king stuck in the corner in front of its own rook pawn cannot "
"get out: the defender only needs to guard f7 and f8. Draw."
msgstr ""
"El rey atacante, encerrado en la esquina delante de su propio peón de torre,"
" no puede salir: al defensor le basta vigilar f7 y f8. Tablas."

#. Rule taught by a lesson position.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/lessons.py:579
msgid ""
"The bishop controls the promotion square: it takes the corner from the king,"
" and the pawn promotes. Win."
msgstr ""
"El alfil controla la casilla de coronación: le quita la esquina al rey y el "
"peón corona. Se gana."

#. Rule taught by a lesson position.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/lessons.py:567
msgid ""
"The bishop does not control the promotion square and the defending king sits"
" in the corner: nothing can push it out. Draw. Check the color of the corner"
" before trading down."
msgstr ""
"El alfil no controla la casilla de coronación y el rey defensor está en la "
"esquina: nada puede sacarlo. Tablas. Comprueba el color de la esquina antes "
"de cambiar piezas."

#. Rule taught by a lesson position.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/lessons.py:531
msgid ""
"The bishop pawn draws: when the queen forces the king in front, it goes to "
"the corner instead, and taking the pawn is stalemate. Draw while your king "
"is far."
msgstr ""
"El peón de alfil entabla: cuando la dama obliga al rey a ponerse delante, "
"este se va a la esquina, y tomar el peón es ahogado. Tablas mientras tu rey "
"esté lejos."

#. Description of the challenge level that follows the user's rating.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/trainer.py:238
msgid "The difficulty tracks your own tactics rating as you improve."
msgstr "La dificultad sigue tu propio rating de táctica a medida que mejoras."

#. Message shown when the puzzle database download failed. Message shown when
#. the tablebase download failed.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/graphical_interface/download_dialog.py:354
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/graphical_interface/tablebase_dialog.py:217
msgid "The download failed: {reason}"
msgstr "La descarga falló: {reason}"

#. Rule taught by a lesson position.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/lessons.py:360
msgid ""
"The exception: against a rook pawn the knight in the corner has no square to"
" come back to, and it falls. Lost for the knight."
msgstr ""
"La excepción: contra un peón de torre, el caballo en la esquina no tiene "
"casilla a la que volver, y cae. Perdido para el caballo."

#. Spoken when the chosen PGN file has no games.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/__init__.py:329
msgid "The file contains no games"
msgstr "El archivo no contiene partidas"

#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/__init__.py:336
msgid "The file contains the following games"
msgstr "El archivo contiene las siguientes partidas"

#. Spoken at the end of a replayed PGN game, with the Termination tag of the
#. file.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/virtual_chessboard/pgn_player.py:65
msgid "The game has been terminated because of: {reason}"
msgstr "La partida se ha terminado por: {reason}"

#. Shown when the study log could not be read.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/graphical_interface/study_dialog.py:82
msgid "The history could not be read."
msgstr "No se pudo leer el historial."

#. Name of a puzzle theme.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/theme_names.py:60
msgid "The king is mated on its home rank, trapped by its own pieces."
msgstr ""
"El rey recibe mate en su primera fila, atrapado por sus propias piezas."

#. Title of a lesson position.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/lessons.py:142
msgid "The king leads"
msgstr "El rey va delante"

#. Rule taught by a lesson position.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/lessons.py:276
msgid ""
"The king on the sixth rank in front of its pawn wins whoever is to move. "
"Step to the side, the pawn follows, and the defending king cannot cover both"
" squares."
msgstr ""
"El rey en sexta delante de su peón gana sea quien sea el que mueva. Da un "
"paso al lado, el peón lo sigue, y el rey defensor no puede cubrir las dos "
"casillas."

#. Rule taught by a lesson position.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/lessons.py:252
msgid ""
"The king two squares in front of its pawn wins whoever is to move: it takes "
"the opposition, or the pawn's spare move gives it back."
msgstr ""
"El rey dos casillas delante de su peón gana sea quien sea el que mueva: toma"
" la oposición, o la jugada de reserva del peón se la devuelve."

#. Name of a puzzle theme.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/theme_names.py:135
msgid ""
"The king's two sideways escape squares are taken by its own pieces, and the "
"queen mates from the front."
msgstr ""
"Las dos casillas de escape laterales del rey están ocupadas por sus propias "
"piezas, y la dama da mate de frente."

#. Rule taught by a lesson position.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/lessons.py:519
msgid ""
"The knight pawn loses the same way: the king in front of the pawn gives your"
" king a step each time. Win."
msgstr ""
"El peón de caballo pierde de la misma manera: el rey delante del peón le da "
"a tu rey un paso cada vez. Se gana."

#. Description of the lesson on rook and pawn against rook.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/lessons.py:432
msgid ""
"The most common endgame in practice. Philidor draws, a passive rook loses, "
"Lucena wins with the bridge."
msgstr ""
"El final más frecuente en la práctica. Philidor entabla, una torre pasiva "
"pierde, Lucena gana con el puente."

#. Description of the beginner training plan.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/trainer.py:63
msgid ""
"The most common tactical patterns: short mates, hanging pieces, forks, pins "
"and skewers. Pick an easier challenge level to keep the positions short."
msgstr ""
"Los patrones tácticos más comunes: mates cortos, piezas colgadas, ataques "
"dobles, clavadas y pinchos. Elige un nivel de desafío más fácil para "
"mantener las posiciones cortas."

#. Title of a lesson position.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/lessons.py:406
msgid "The outside passed pawn"
msgstr "El peón pasado alejado"

#. Rule taught by a lesson position.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/lessons.py:408
msgid ""
"The outside passed pawn does not promote: it decoys. The defending king must"
" go and fetch it, and your king eats on the other side."
msgstr ""
"El peón pasado alejado no corona: distrae. El rey defensor tiene que ir a "
"buscarlo, y tu rey come en el otro lado."

#. Title of a lesson position.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/lessons.py:468
msgid "The passive rook loses"
msgstr "La torre pasiva pierde"

#. Rule taught by a lesson position.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/lessons.py:457
msgid ""
"The pawn is on the sixth and the attacking king wants the sixth too: now the"
" rook checks from behind, without stopping. The king has nowhere to hide "
"from the checks. Draw."
msgstr ""
"El peón está en sexta y el rey atacante también quiere la sexta: ahora la "
"torre da jaque desde atrás, sin parar. El rey no tiene dónde esconderse de "
"los jaques. Tablas."

#. Description of the queen mate lesson.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/lessons.py:77
msgid ""
"The queen alone cannot mate: drive the king to the edge, bring your own king"
" up, mind the stalemate. Under 10 moves."
msgstr ""
"La dama sola no puede dar mate: lleva al rey al borde, acerca tu propio rey,"
" cuidado con el ahogado. Menos de 10 jugadas."

#. Spoken when the lesson position was not held.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/virtual_chessboard/endgame_board.py:609
msgid "The result slipped. Control+R plays the same position again."
msgstr "El resultado se escapó. Control+R juega la misma posición otra vez."

#. Title of a lesson position.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/lessons.py:577
msgid "The right bishop"
msgstr "El alfil bueno"

#. Rule taught by a lesson position.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/lessons.py:470
msgid ""
"The rook on the seventh instead of the third rank, and the king in front of "
"the pawn: the attacking king reaches the sixth and it is lost. Without the "
"third rank there is no Philidor."
msgstr ""
"La torre en séptima en lugar de en tercera, y el rey delante del peón: el "
"rey atacante llega a la sexta y está perdido. Sin la tercera fila no hay "
"Philidor."

#. Rule taught by a lesson position.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/lessons.py:543
msgid ""
"The rook pawn draws: the king hides in the corner in front of it and there "
"is no check that does not stalemate. Draw while your king is far."
msgstr ""
"El peón de torre entabla: el rey se esconde en la esquina delante de él y no"
" hay jaque que no sea ahogado. Tablas mientras tu rey esté lejos."

#. Rule taught by a lesson position.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/lessons.py:204
msgid ""
"The rook pawn wins when the defending king reaches neither the corner nor "
"the square of the pawn. Push it: count the squares first."
msgstr ""
"El peón de torre gana cuando el rey defensor no llega ni a la esquina ni al "
"cuadrado del peón. Empújalo: primero cuenta las casillas."

#. Description of the lesson on king and pawn against king.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/lessons.py:216
msgid ""
"The rule of the square, the king in front of the pawn, and the pawn on the "
"sixth: what wins, what draws, and why."
msgstr ""
"La regla del cuadrado, el rey delante del peón y el peón en sexta: qué gana,"
" qué entabla y por qué."

#. Title of a lesson position.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/lessons.py:238
msgid "The rule of the square: inside"
msgstr "La regla del cuadrado: dentro"

#. Title of a lesson position.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/lessons.py:226
msgid "The rule of the square: outside"
msgstr "La regla del cuadrado: fuera"

#. Title of a lesson position.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/lessons.py:166
msgid "The same position, Black to move"
msgstr "La misma posición, juegan las negras"

#. Name of a puzzle theme.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/theme_names.py:184
msgid "The solution ends in checkmate."
msgstr "La solución termina en jaque mate."

#. Name of a puzzle theme.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/theme_names.py:203
msgid "The solution is a single move."
msgstr "La solución es una sola jugada."

#. Name of a puzzle theme.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/theme_names.py:34
msgid "The solution wins a clear advantage, worth roughly two to four pawns."
msgstr "La solución gana una ventaja clara, de unos dos a cuatro peones."

#. Description of the lesson on pawns on both sides.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/lessons.py:384
msgid ""
"The spare tempo of doubled pawns, the outside passed pawn that decoys, and "
"pawn against pawn where each king holds one."
msgstr ""
"El tempo de reserva de los peones doblados, el peón pasado alejado que "
"distrae, y peón contra peón donde cada rey frena uno."

#. Name of a puzzle theme.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/theme_names.py:131
msgid "The tactic involves capturing a pawn en passant."
msgstr "La táctica incluye una captura al paso."

#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/__init__.py:175
msgid ""
"The tactics database was not found. Choose a valid database in Chessboard "
"settings first."
msgstr ""
"No se encontró la base de táctica. Primero elige una base válida en las "
"opciones del tablero de ajedrez."

#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/__init__.py:129
msgid ""
"The tactics database was not found. Use Browse in the tactics dialog to "
"point at your puzzle database, or place it in the add-on's data folder as "
"puzzles.db."
msgstr ""
"No se encontró la base de táctica. Usa Examinar en el diálogo de táctica "
"para indicar tu base de problemas, o colócala en la carpeta de datos del "
"complemento como puzzles.db."

#. Spoken when the mate took longer than the drill's target.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/drills.py:252
msgid "The target was under {target} moves."
msgstr "El objetivo era menos de {target} jugadas."

#. Announced when the theme catalog could not be built.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/graphical_interface/tactics_setup.py:395
msgid "The theme catalog could not be built."
msgstr "No se pudo construir el catálogo de temas."

#. Description of the hardest fixed challenge level.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/trainer.py:225
msgid "The top of the database, with no popularity filter."
msgstr "Lo mejor de la base, sin filtro de popularidad."

#. Name of a puzzle theme.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/theme_names.py:88
msgid ""
"The winning move slides along the same line as the opponent's last move."
msgstr ""
"La jugada ganadora se desliza por la misma línea que la última jugada del "
"rival."

#. Title of a lesson position.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/lessons.py:565
msgid "The wrong bishop"
msgstr "El alfil malo"

#. Description of the lesson on bishop and rook pawn.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/lessons.py:555
msgid ""
"The wrong bishop cannot win: it does not control the promotion square, and "
"the king in the corner never leaves."
msgstr ""
"El alfil malo no puede ganar: no controla la casilla de coronación, y el rey"
" en la esquina no sale nunca."

#. Message shown when the puzzle database was installed successfully.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/graphical_interface/download_dialog.py:328
msgid "The {name} puzzle database is installed: {count:,} puzzles."
msgstr "La base de problemas {name} está instalada: {count:,} problemas."

#. Announced when the theme catalog finished building in the background.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/graphical_interface/tactics_setup.py:392
msgid "Theme catalog ready. You can select themes now."
msgstr "Catálogo de temas listo. Ya puedes seleccionar temas."

#. Label for the themes field.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/graphical_interface/tactics_dialog.py:69
msgid "Themes"
msgstr "Temas"

#. Title of the no-themes warning.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/graphical_interface/tactics_setup.py:355
msgid "Themes Not Found"
msgstr "Temas no encontrados"

#. Part of the training summary when every theme is in play.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/graphical_interface/tactics_setup.py:247
msgid "Themes: all of them."
msgstr "Temas: todos."

#. Part of the training summary. {count} is a number of themes.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/graphical_interface/tactics_setup.py:249
msgid ""
"Themes: {count} in play, chosen by the training plan and not by the level."
msgstr ""
"Temas: {count} en juego, elegidos por el plan de entrenamiento y no por el "
"nivel."

#. Part of the session description, e.g. "Themes: Fork, Pin".
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/training_session.py:254
msgid "Themes: {themes}"
msgstr "Temas: {themes}"

#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/virtual_chessboard/puzzle_board.py:714
msgid "Themes: {themes}."
msgstr "Temas: {themes}."

#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/virtual_chessboard/puzzle_board.py:735
msgid "There are no more hints for this puzzle."
