#. What to do in the two bishops against king drill.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/drills.py:96
msgid ""
"Checkmate in under 20 moves. The two bishops side by side make a wall: push "
"the king to the edge, then into a corner, with your own king close behind. "
"Mind the stalemate."
msgstr ""
"Jaque mate en menos de 20 jugadas. Los dos alfiles uno junto al otro forman "
"una pared: empuja al rey al borde, luego a una esquina, con tu propio rey "
"justo detrás. Cuidado con el ahogado."

#. What to do in the bishop and knight against king drill.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/drills.py:108
msgid ""
"Checkmate in under 35 moves. The mate only exists in a corner of the "
"bishop's colour: drive the king to the edge, then along it to the right "
"corner. Give yourself a longer clock."
msgstr ""
"Jaque mate en menos de 35 jugadas. El mate solo existe en una esquina del "
"color del alfil: lleva al rey al borde y luego, por el borde, hasta la "
"esquina correcta. Date un reloj más largo."

#. Description of the two bishops mate lesson.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/lessons.py:110
msgid ""
"The bishops side by side make a wall the king cannot cross. Push it to the "
"edge, then into a corner, and mate with the king close behind. Under 20 "
"moves."
msgstr ""
"Los alfiles uno junto al otro forman una pared que el rey no puede cruzar. "
"Empújalo al borde, luego a una esquina, y da mate con el rey justo detrás. "
"Menos de 20 jugadas."

#. Description of the bishop and knight mate lesson.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/lessons.py:121
msgid ""
"The hardest elementary mate: it only exists in the corner of the bishop's "
"colour. Drive the king to the edge, then along the edge to the right corner,"
" knight and bishop taking turns. Under 35 moves."
msgstr ""
"El mate elemental más difícil: solo existe en la esquina del color del "
"alfil. Lleva al rey al borde y luego, por el borde, hasta la esquina "
"correcta, turnando caballo y alfil. Menos de 35 jugadas."

#. Name of the endgame drill with two bishops and king against king.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/drills.py:94
msgid "Two bishops and king against king"
msgstr "Dos alfiles y rey contra rey"

#. Name of the endgame lesson (a drill) with two rooks.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/lessons.py:97
msgid "1c. Mate with two rooks"
msgstr "1c. Mate con dos torres"

#. Name of the endgame lesson (a drill) with two bishops.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/lessons.py:108
msgid "1d. Mate with two bishops"
msgstr "1d. Mate con dos alfiles"

#. Name of the endgame lesson (a drill) with bishop and knight.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/lessons.py:119
msgid "1e. Mate with bishop and knight"
msgstr "1e. Mate con alfil y caballo"

#. What to do in the two rooks against king drill.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/drills.py:84
msgid ""
"Checkmate in under 10 moves. The ladder: one rook cuts the king off along a "
"rank, the other checks on the next rank, and they take turns. When the king "
"comes close to a rook, move that rook far away along its rank. Your king "
"stays out of it."
msgstr ""
"Jaque mate en menos de 10 jugadas. La escalera: una torre corta al rey en "
"una fila, la otra da jaque en la fila siguiente, y se turnan. Cuando el rey "
"se acerca a una torre, aleja esa torre por su misma fila. Tu rey no "
"interviene."

#. Description of the two rooks mate lesson.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/lessons.py:99
msgid ""
"The ladder mate: the rooks take turns cutting off a rank and checking on the"
" next, until the king runs out of board. Under 10 moves."
msgstr ""
"El mate de la escalera: las torres se turnan cortando una fila y dando jaque"
" en la siguiente, hasta que al rey se le acaba el tablero. Menos de 10 "
"jugadas."

#. Name of the endgame drill with two rooks and king against king.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/drills.py:82
msgid "Two rooks and king against king"
msgstr "Dos torres y rey contra rey"

#. Name of the endgame lesson on practical rook endings.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/lessons.py:589
msgid "9. Rook endings: the ones that decide games"
msgstr "9. Finales de torre: los que deciden partidas"

#. Rule taught by a lesson position.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/lessons.py:668
msgid ""
"Add the pawn's rank to the number of files between the defending king and "
"the pawn. Four plus two is six, more than five: the king cannot get back in "
"time. Advance the king ahead of the pawn and win."
msgstr ""
"Suma la fila del peón al número de columnas entre el rey defensor y el peón."
" Cuatro más dos son seis, más que cinco: el rey no vuelve a tiempo. Avanza "
"el rey por delante del peón y gana."

#. Description of the lesson on practical rook endings.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/lessons.py:591
msgid ""
"Beyond Philidor and Lucena: the short side, Vancura against the rook pawn, "
"the back-rank defence, the rule of five, and the rook behind the passed "
"pawn. Four of them come in pairs, the right way and the wrong way."
msgstr ""
"Más allá de Philidor y Lucena: el lado corto, Vancura contra el peón de "
"torre, la defensa de la última fila, la regla de los cinco y la torre detrás"
" del peón pasado. Cuatro de ellos vienen en pares, de la forma correcta y de"
" la incorrecta."

#. Rule taught by a lesson position.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/lessons.py:680
msgid ""
"Same cut, pawn one rank back. Three plus two is five, not more: the "
"defending king gets back to the pawn's file in time. Draw. Do not force it; "
"keep the pieces active."
msgstr ""
"Mismo corte, peón una fila atrás. Tres más dos son cinco, no más: el rey "
"defensor vuelve a tiempo a la columna del peón. Tablas. No lo fuerces; "
"mantén las piezas activas."

#. Rule taught by a lesson position.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/lessons.py:642
msgid ""
"Same ending with your rook behind the pawn. The attacking king walks to b7, "
"the rook leaves a8 with check, and the pawn promotes. Lost: against the rook"
" pawn, behind is the wrong place."
msgstr ""
"Mismo final con tu torre detrás del peón. El rey atacante camina hasta b7, "
"la torre sale de a8 con jaque y el peón corona. Perdido: contra el peón de "
"torre, detrás es el lugar equivocado."

#. Rule taught by a lesson position.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/lessons.py:616
msgid ""
"Same ending, king on the wrong side. Now the rook checks from the short "
"side, two files away, and the king walks up to it: the checks run out and "
"the pawn promotes. Lost."
msgstr ""
"Mismo final, rey en el lado equivocado. Ahora la torre da jaque desde el "
"lado corto, a dos columnas, y el rey se le acerca: los jaques se acaban y el"
" peón corona. Perdido."

#. Title of a lesson position.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/lessons.py:690
msgid "Tarrasch: the rook behind the passed pawn"
msgstr "Tarrasch: la torre detrás del peón pasado"

#. Title of a lesson position.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/lessons.py:702
msgid "Tarrasch: the rook in front of its own pawn"
msgstr "Tarrasch: la torre delante de su propio peón"

#. Title of a lesson position.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/lessons.py:653
msgid "The back-rank defence against a knight pawn"
msgstr "La defensa de la última fila contra el peón de caballo"

#. Title of a lesson position.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/lessons.py:666
msgid "The rule of five: pawn on the fourth, king cut off by two files"
msgstr "La regla de los cinco: peón en cuarta, rey cortado por dos columnas"

#. Title of a lesson position.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/lessons.py:678
msgid "The rule of five: pawn on the third"
msgstr "La regla de los cinco: peón en tercera"

#. Title of a lesson position.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/lessons.py:614
msgid "The short side: king on the long side"
msgstr "El lado corto: rey en el lado largo"

#. Title of a lesson position.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/lessons.py:601
msgid "The short side: king on the short side, rook on the long side"
msgstr "El lado corto: rey en el lado corto, torre en el lado largo"

#. Title of a lesson position.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/lessons.py:640
msgid "Vancura: the passive rook behind the pawn"
msgstr "Vancura: la torre pasiva detrás del peón"

#. Title of a lesson position.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/lessons.py:627
msgid "Vancura: the rook attacks the rook pawn from the side"
msgstr "Vancura: la torre ataca al peón de torre desde el lado"

#. Rule taught by a lesson position.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/lessons.py:629
msgid ""
"You defend against a rook pawn on the sixth with the attacking rook in front"
" of it. Keep your rook on the third rank, hitting the pawn from the side, "
"and check whenever the king comes to protect it: it never finds shelter. "
"Draw."
msgstr ""
"Defiendes contra un peón de torre en sexta con la torre atacante delante de "
"él. Mantén tu torre en la tercera fila, atacando al peón desde el lado, y da"
" jaque cada vez que el rey venga a protegerlo: nunca encuentra refugio. "
"Tablas."

#. Rule taught by a lesson position.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/lessons.py:655
msgid ""
"You defend with the king in front of a knight pawn on the sixth and the rook"
" on the back rank. Just wait: the rook shuffles along the back rank, the "
"king cannot be driven out, and there is no mate. Draw. It only works against"
" a rook pawn or a knight pawn."
msgstr ""
"Defiendes con el rey delante de un peón de caballo en sexta y la torre en la"
" última fila. Solo espera: la torre se pasea por la última fila, al rey no "
"se le puede expulsar y no hay mate. Tablas. Solo funciona contra peón de "
"torre o de caballo."

#. Rule taught by a lesson position.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/lessons.py:603
msgid ""
"You defend, and the pawn is already on the seventh. Your king stays on the "
"short side of the pawn, so the rook has the long side to check from: three "
"files of distance or more, and the checks never run out. Draw."
msgstr ""
"Defiendes, y el peón ya está en séptima. Tu rey se queda en el lado corto "
"del peón, para que la torre tenga el lado largo desde donde dar jaque: tres "
"columnas de distancia o más, y los jaques nunca se acaban. Tablas."

#. Rule taught by a lesson position.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/lessons.py:704
msgid ""
"You defend, and their rook is in front of its own rook pawn: it cannot leave"
" a8 without losing the pawn. Keep your rook behind the pawn and your king on"
" g7 and h7, and check the king whenever it comes near. Draw as long as the "
"king stays away."
msgstr ""
"Defiendes, y su torre está delante de su propio peón de torre: no puede "
"salir de a8 sin perder el peón. Mantén tu torre detrás del peón y tu rey en "
"g7 y h7, y da jaque al rey cada vez que se acerque. Tablas mientras el rey "
"se mantenga lejos."

#. Rule taught by a lesson position.
#: addon/globalPlugins/chessmart/endgame/lessons.py:692
msgid ""
"Your rook stands behind your passed pawn, theirs stands in front of it and "
"is tied to it. Every pawn step gains your rook a rank and costs theirs one. "
"Bring the king to the pawn and win."
msgstr ""
"Tu torre está detrás de tu peón pasado; la suya está delante y atada a él. "
"Cada paso del peón le da una fila a tu torre y le quita una a la suya. Lleva"
" el rey hasta el peón y gana."

#. what's new content for the add-on version to be shown in the add-on store
#: buildVars.py:35
msgid ""
"1.1.0: Endgames: mate drills (queen, rook, two rooks, two bishops, and "
"bishop and knight) against the engine at full strength, and nine lessons "
"that follow the endgame course order (opposition, king and pawn, piece "
"against pawn, pawns on both sides, rook and pawn against rook, queen against"
" pawn, bishop and rook pawn, and the practical rook endings: short side, "
"Vancura, back rank, rule of five, rook behind the passed pawn): each "
"position asks win, draw or loss, tells the rule and is played out with the "
"Syzygy tablebase as judge; tablebases up to 5 pieces downloaded from the "
"Lichess mirror; a log of every attempt. 1.0.2: Escape asks before leaving a "
"game in progress and really closes the board (engine, clock and online game "
"included); an untouched puzzle no longer counts as a failure; online board "
"fixes (start, server clock, draw offers, resignation, refused moves, "
"reconnect); challenge levels and puzzle themes with real names and "
"descriptions. 1.0.1: the complete puzzle database is downloaded in parts, "
"with each part verified as it arrives and retried on its own if the "
"connection drops. 1.0.0: first public release of the tactics trainer: "
"Lichess puzzle database downloaded on demand (light or complete) and updated"
" monthly, Glicko-2 tactics rating with adaptive difficulty, training plans "
"by theme, configurable move notation (descriptive, SAN, UCI, literate, NATO,"
" anna) and Brazilian Portuguese translation."
msgstr ""
"1.1.0: Finales: ejercicios de mate (dama y torre) contra el motor a plena "
"fuerza, y nueve lecciones que siguen el orden de los cursos de finales "
"(oposición, rey y peón, pieza contra peón, peones en ambos flancos, torre y "
"peón contra torre, dama contra peón, alfil y peón de torre, y los finales de"
" torre prácticos: lado corto, Vancura, última fila, regla de los cinco, "
"torre detrás del peón pasado): cada posición pregunta si se gana, se entabla"
" o se pierde, enuncia la regla y se juega hasta el final con la tablebase "
"Syzygy como juez; tablebases de hasta 5 piezas descargadas desde el espejo "
"de Lichess; un registro de cada intento. 1.0.2: Escape pregunta antes de "
"abandonar una partida en curso y cierra de verdad el tablero (motor, reloj y"
" partida en línea incluidos); un problema sin tocar ya no cuenta como fallo;"
" correcciones del tablero en línea (inicio, reloj del servidor, ofertas de "
"tablas, abandono, jugadas rechazadas, reconexión); niveles de desafío y "
"temas de problemas con nombres y descripciones reales. 1.0.1: la base "
"completa de problemas se descarga por partes, cada parte se verifica al "
"llegar y se reintenta sola si se corta la conexión. 1.0.0: primera versión "
"pública del entrenador de táctica: base de problemas de Lichess descargada a"
" demanda (ligera o completa) y actualizada cada mes, rating de táctica "
"Glicko-2 con dificultad adaptativa, planes de entrenamiento por tema, "
"notación de jugadas configurable (descriptiva, SAN, UCI, literal, OTAN, "
"anna) y traducción al portugués de Brasil."

